OL,3,GNEWSAComplaint made over Reform
OL,4,Acouncillor's 'predatory' X posts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sacked councillor's social media
OL,7,Fposts that have been described as
OL,8,F"predatory" by an opposition party are
OL,9,Fbeing investigated by the council.
OL,11,FReform UK's Chris Hudson was removed
OL,12,Ffrom his Suffolk County Council's
OL,13,Fcabinet job on Tuesday after he posted
OL,14,Fa sexualised AI image of a female
OL,15,Fcolleague.
OL,17,FThe council confirmed complaints had
OL,18,Fbeen filed with its monitoring officer
OL,19,Fover his social media activity, one of
OL,20,Fwhich the BBC understands involves an
OL,21,Fallegation of interaction with accounts
OL,22,Fof young women offering adult content.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
